Subject: [PATCH 34/54] arm64: dts: renesas: salvator-common: Add BD9571 PMIC
Date: Thu,  7 Dec 2017 10:53:37 +0100
Message-Id: <f80f4920b78dbcbebbe5e0a1383bce7849cd08af.1512640145.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
